{"timestamp":"2026-10-14T20:08:20.474Z","ordinal":840,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_01a13c07-b4f9-7913-b15e-0a8645c80fc3","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Continue Project D from verified GitHub commit 74fad6313b1f65ce7fbf015c3cbfa35122d09896.\n\nImplement Step 152: the connected ordinary travel-expense claim workflow.\n\nUse the existing code, original interview export, retained source records, and financial reconciliation implementation.\n\nBuild and connect these stages:\n\nTravel permission and trip-to-claim linkage.\n\nClaim revision, receipts, and supporting-evidence validation.\n\nPolicy eligibility checks, but only where actual source evidence supports them.\n\nRequired human review and approval evidence.\n\nReimbursement request and recorded Finance obligation linkage.\n\nConfirmed payments, refunds, adjustments, and outstanding balance reconciliation.\n\nFinancial closure when every required condition is supported; otherwise preserve a pending state and an owner-specific repair action.\n\nDemonstrate the workflow with an actual retained claim, showing its source references and which stages pass or remain blocked.\n\nIf no real claim can legitimately close, use a clearly labeled synthetic test fixture to verify the successful closure path. Do not fabricate approval or closure for real claims.\n\nPreserve all four arrival batches, corrections, cancellations, event histories, and previous run artifacts.\n\nAdd regression tests checking claim identities, revisions, source references, monetary amounts, and state transitions.\n\nGenerate a new labeled offline replay without overwriting previous artifacts.\n\nRun the complete pytest suite and git diff --check.\n\nDo not commit or push yet.\n\nReport changed files, the real claim demonstrated, successful and blocked transitions, test results, and remaining gaps."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a13c07-abde-7561-8a83-1bb986e74dae","create_time":1792008500.4738793,"content_item_kinds":["user.text"]}},"metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_01a13c07-b4f9-7913-b15e-0a8645c80fc3","turn_id":"01a13c07-abde-7561-8a83-1bb986e74dae","role":"user"},"revision":"retained_01a13c07-b4fa-76b2-91d1-03edd9a54695","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":63,"mcp_attribution":{"status":"none"}}}
