ions independently of claim existence. Preserve initiation, confirmation, source references, and any unresolved financial disposition.\n\nPropagate cancellation effects to linked claims and requests without incorrectly blocking unrelated claims.\n\nDistinguish a cancelled transfer from a cash refund, and preserve actual Finance event identity and history.\n\nDemonstrate representative retained correction and cancellation cases with exact source references and before/after states.\n\nAdd regression tests for stale approvals, changed receipts, revised amounts, duplicate events, partial cancellation information, and independent no-claim cancellations.\n\nGenerate a new labeled offline replay and verification report without overwriting prior artifacts.\n\nRun the complete pytest suite, snapshot integrity checks, and git diff --check.\n\nDo not invent approvals, policy rules, cancellation confirmations, refunds, or the missing case clock. Preserve all earlier artifacts and the original interview.\n\nDo not commit or push yet.\n\nReport changed files, demonstrated cases, executed transitions, remaining blockers, and tests passed.","type":"input_text"}],"guardian_metadata":{"client_authored":false,"mcp_attribution":{"status":"none"},"user_input_order":80},"id":"msg_01a13c1b-1f15-76b0-86df-f439e8dab010","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1792009772.8211133,"turn_id":"01a13c1b-19a6-7c30-952c-e0611fda1bab"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"I’ll trace the retained corrections and cancellation lifecycles, then connect each affected dependency to an executed recheck and an evidence-backed result. I’ll preserve unrelated work and prior artifacts, demonstrate the before/after cases in a new offline run, and leave the changes uncommitted.","type":"output_text"}],"guardian_metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":81},"id":"msg_02f4b2bd528e1b90016acfe62fa640819088c81c6e18c15e00","internal_cha