{"timestamp":"2026-10-14T20:32:02.512Z","ordinal":1172,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a13bd1-7420-72c0-963e-58742d1be7bf","turn_id":"01a13c1b-19a6-7c30-952c-e0611fda1bab","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_02f4b2bd528e1b90016acfe6c0ed248190bd765b72fab69d9c","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The retained interview explicitly requires current-revision reviews after material corrections, while preserving prior reviews and Finance history. It also separates cancellation confirmation from Finance disposition. The integration already reruns the ordinary checks, but it does not record their correction-specific before/after results, and cancellation links currently combine historical and current claim revisions. I’m addressing both gaps."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1792009921205,"completed_at_ms":1792009922512}}
