{"timestamp":"2026-10-14T21:18:26.125Z","ordinal":1951,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a13bd1-7420-72c0-963e-58742d1be7bf","turn_id":"01a13c45-9846-7111-9cb7-eca8b1cc3957","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_02f4b2bd528e1b90016acff19f8b448190a1682b28e1e4374c","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"I’m separating admitted facts from incoming deliveries so a conflicting redelivery can open a Finance hold without erasing admitted money or cancellation history. New Finance events will require source-bound request and directory context; cancellation confirmation will require the matching target, authorized supervisor, and valid UTC timing.\n\nFor future-observation checks, a date-only clock can establish that earlier local dates have passed. Events on the case date itself will remain held unless a cutoff time is supplied. I won’t infer midnight."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1792012703759,"completed_at_ms":1792012706124}}
