cial dependencies after material claim corrections, preserving unaffected records.\n\nUpdate claim projections, repair queue items, and report outputs only where supported by evidence.\n\nAdd regression tests using representative retained records, including duplicate events, corrections, and independent cancellations.\n\nRun the full test suite and git diff --check.\n\nGenerate a new labeled offline replay without overwriting prior artifacts.\n\nDo not invent approvals, payment confirmations, policy limits, or case-clock dates. Do not commit or push yet.\n\nReport changed files, tests passed, which financial facts were successfully linked, and what remains blocked.","type":"input_text"}],"guardian_metadata":{"client_authored":false,"mcp_attribution":{"status":"none"},"retained_source":{"complete":true,"id":{"message_id":"msg_01a13bf7-8871-7d10-8b35-9dea435e5af1","role":"user","turn_id":"01a13bf7-84ed-7580-8f9b-351b17474778"},"revision":"retained_01a13bf7-8871-7d10-8b35-9e0566b7f80f"},"user_input_order":48},"id":"msg_01a13bf7-8871-7d10-8b35-9dea435e5af1","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1792007440.497253,"turn_id":"01a13bf7-84ed-7580-8f9b-351b17474778"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"Preserve the completed Project D financial source reconciliation milestone.\n\n    Inspect git status, the exact source diff, and all staged changes.\n\n    Stage ONLY these files:\n\n        README.md\n\n        snapshot.schema.json\n\n        src/travel_claim/finance.py\n\n        src/travel_claim/integration.py\n\n        src/travel_claim/offline_replay.py\n\n        tests/test_retained_finance.py\n\n        tests/fixtures/retained_finance_records.json\n\n    Do not stage artifacts/runs/, artifacts/verification/, or unrelated files.\n\n    Run git diff --cached --check and the complete pytest suite.\n\n    If validation passes, commit with:\n    feat: reconcile retained Finance obligations and refunds\