g commitments: **€3,000**\n- Available: **€2,965.85**\n\nRetained C03/C24 tests exclude the existing €200 obligation, leaving €50 for the additional request. Transfer cancellation, request cancellation, and refunds remain distinct.\n\nChanged files:\n\n- `README.md`\n- `src/travel_claim/budget.py`\n- `src/travel_claim/approvals.py`\n- `src/travel_claim/integration.py`\n- `src/travel_claim/offline_replay.py`\n- `src/travel_claim/ordinary.py`\n- `src/travel_claim/readiness.py`\n- `src/travel_claim/snapshots.py`\n- `tests/test_budget.py`\n- `tests/test_approvals.py`\n- `tests/test_exceptions.py`\n- `tests/fixtures/retained_budget_records.json`\n\nMissing current budget-owner authorization, insufficient source-version evidence, ambiguous cost allocations, and conflicting Finance facts remain held. Existing native request and closure gaps remain separate blockers; no real claim was newly authorized or closed.\n\nNothing staged, committed, or pushed.","type":"output_text"}],"guardian_metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":200},"id":"msg_02f4b2bd528e1b90016ad028ec8ed88190b5ae45ad73374ca7","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["unknown"],"create_time":1792026860.5614078,"turn_id":"01a13d0d-9f67-7c00-8955-722676671362"},"phase":"final_answer","role":"assistant","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"Project D — Step 180: Commit and push the verified Step 179 budget reconciliation milestone.\n\nVerify the current branch, Git status, and complete diff against HEAD 7015dde20ccd6a2327985c0eb26899ecf97c3974.\n\nConfirm the changes are limited to the 12 reviewed Step 179 files.\n\nRerun the full test suite and Git diff checks.\n\nVerify all 129 preserved-file hashes match, including the interview, policy, previous snapshots, outputs, and protected Finance and closure code.\n\nStage only these files:\n\nREADME.md\n\nsrc/travel_claim/budget.py\n\nsrc/travel_claim/approvals.py\n\nsrc/travel_claim/integration.py\n\nsrc/travel_claim/offline_replay.py\n\nsrc/travel_claim/ordinary.py\n\nsrc/travel_claim/readiness.py\n\nsrc/travel_claim/snapshots.py\n\ntests/test_budget.py\n\ntests/test_approvals.py\n\ntests/test_exceptions.py\n\ntests/fixtures/retained_budget_records.json\n\nCommit with message: feat: reconcile budgets and prepaid cost commitments\n\nPush normally to origin main without force-pushing.\n\nVerify remote main matches the local commit and every Entire.io checkpoint reference matches remotely.","type":"input_text"}],"guardian_metadata":{"client_authored":false,"mcp_attribution":{"status":"none"},"user_input_order":201},"id":"msg_01a13d21-b0c1-7f12-bd50-4aeeb77b1bdf","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1792026980.5454373,"turn_id":"01a13d21-a9c0-7872-9e35-080056b8fba9"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"I’ll verify the 12-file diff against `7015dde`, rerun the tests and preservation checks, then commit and push through the existing Entire.io hooks if validation passes.","type":"output_text"}],"guardian_metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":202},"id":"msg_02f4b2bd528e1b90016ad0296702588190a1292ed8eaf45e44","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["unknown"],"create_time":1792026983.017467,"turn_id":"01a13d21-a9c0-7872-9e35-080056b8fba9"},"phase":"commentary","role":"assistant","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"\u003cturn_aborted\u003e\nThe previous turn was interrupted on purpose. Any running unified exec processes may still be running in the background. If any tools/commands were aborted, they may have partially executed.\n\u003c/turn_aborted\u003e","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a13d21-c1dc-7920-b9c5-bbdb06376263","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["generic.turn_aborted"],"create_time":1792026984.9240706,"turn_id":"01a13d21-a9c0-7872-9e35-080056b8fba9"},"role":"developer","type":"message"}],"latest_token_usage_record":{"response_id":