{"timestamp":"2026-10-15T11:23:30.422Z","ordinal":4598,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a13bd1-7420-72c0-963e-58742d1be7bf","turn_id":"01a13f48-7c83-7c72-a773-e78f5db417e4","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_02f4b2bd528e1b90016ad0b7aefef08190ba44ff9d7734ac1e","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The regressions confirm that legacy gates still reject the verified date-only clock and clean zero-entitlement completion. They also show that a same-total correction after payment can close without Finance resolution, cancellation-aware packets are not checked for freshness, and the recorded ledger ignores request-bound Finance cancellation. The fixes will preserve cash history, distinguish pre-acceptance cancellation from later cancellation, and require explicit resolution where the policy calls for it."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1792063407480,"completed_at_ms":1792063410422}}
