2b-b93aa1b41147","text":"Implemented both Step 184 fixes.\n\n- Expense admission now checks source hashes, complete observations, and record locators for claims, trip/directory context, receipts, payments, applicable caps/FX, and reused filing evidence. Unverified evidence cannot authorize reimbursement or close the connected workflow.\n- Reviewer admission now enforces the supplied case clock and timezone. Future and ambiguous same-day replies remain visible in history but cannot supply current authority.\n- Connected tests confirm unaffected valid claims still proceed and admitted Finance cash remains preserved.\n\n**451 tests passed**, including 55 new regression cases. Both defects were reproduced before fixing. Git diff and whitespace checks pass.\n\nChanged files:\n\n```text\nREADME.md\nsrc/travel_claim/approvals.py\nsrc/travel_claim/expenses.py\ntests/test_approvals.py\ntests/test_evidence_admission.py\ntests/test_exceptions.py\ntests/test_expenses.py\n```\n\nAll **132 files in the Step 184 start baseline remain unchanged**, including retained artifacts and protected financial modules. The original historical 129-file manifest is unavailable; a fresh comparison against it cannot be claimed.\n\nLegacy closure, cancellation-resolution, and reporting defects identified in Step 183 remain outside this milestone. Native Notion access also remains unresolved.\n\nNothing staged, committed, or pushed. HEAD remains `791c8c787bbd617a7b7d3114f13c000249169151`.","turn_id":"01a13f30-dcaa-7053-8391-0211a28144b2"},{"complete":true,"message_id":"msg_02f4b2bd528e1b90016ad0b5409df88190b328ff1cae6a7c0b","order":256,"phase":"commentary","revision":"retained_01a13f44-0a6c-7612-9424-c07e9dc8e3f8","text":"I’ll verify the seven-file diff, rerun the full test suite, and check the 132-file baseline before staging. If all checks pass, I’ll commit and push through the existing Entire.io hooks, then verify remote main and every checkpoint reference.","turn_id":"01a13f43-f677-78c3-a142-cf