ever by itself creates permit_unapproved for an arrangement/payment made with timely valid permission. Pre-existing late_permit or permit_unapproved findings remain independent and need their own explicit coverage. A cancellation waiver never retroactively approves arrangements. Do not guess ordering between a date-only payment and a same-day cancellation when the timing matters; retain the uncertainty for supervisor/Finance resolution.\n\nBusiness cancellation and Finance cancellation are distinct. When business cancellation is confirmed before any reimbursement request for the affected obligation has been accepted or dispatched, the bound Finance cost disposition and fresh cancellation-aware claim reviews establish the new reimbursement basis. Its first accepted request may close after confirmed settlement matches that basis and no other issue remains; the earlier business cancellation alone does not require a separate Finance resolution event. This does not waive the resolution requirement for a cancellation after acceptance/dispatch or reimbursement. After acceptance/dispatch retain the original request basis and hold competing replacements until supplied Finance status/cancellation/adjustment resolves the obligation. Only Finance accepted/adjustment/cancelled facts change accepted commitments; business confirmation cannot release them. After reimbursement reopen reconciliation; explicit current cost disposition and reviews, any needed linked confirmed refund and Finance resolution must agree before closure. Only the confirmed refund reduces net paid. Continue observing original requests after cancellation or claim reassignment, including late transfers. Maintain separate cancellation state and event references for every observed valid process, including trips with no claim; retain affected claim and original request links, unresolved/no-financial-effect/resolved consequence and next owner. Finance admitted event references remain separate from cancellation event references."},"started_at_ms":1792063731339,"completed_at_ms":1792063731759}}
