Separate authorized obligations, confirmed payments, refunds, and outstanding balances.\n\nOwner-grouped repair findings with exact source references.\n\nNever invent missing allocations, rates, budgets, approvals, or financial events. Preserve unaffected valid claims and admitted Finance history.\n\nAdd focused synthetic and retained-data tests, including budget exhaustion, cross-claim prepaid costs, corrections, cancellations, and replay.\n\nPreserve the policy, interview, previous snapshots and outputs, and all protected event-integrity modules.\n\nDo not modify unrelated approval, Finance-exception, or closure rules.\n\nRun the complete test suite and diff checks. Report changed files, test results, and unresolved blockers.\n\nDo not stage, commit, or push yet. Stop after implementation and verification.","type":"input_text"}],"guardian_metadata":{"client_authored":false,"mcp_attribution":{"status":"none"},"user_input_order":193},"id":"msg_01a13d0d-a660-7553-99ec-3d0158a905df","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1792025667.1689932,"turn_id":"01a13d0d-9f67-7c00-8955-722676671362"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"Project D — Step 180: Commit and push the verified Step 179 budget reconciliation milestone.\n\nVerify the current branch, Git status, and complete diff against HEAD 7015dde20ccd6a2327985c0eb26899ecf97c3974.\n\nConfirm the changes are limited to the 12 reviewed Step 179 files.\n\nRerun the full test suite and Git diff checks.\n\nVerify all 129 preserved-file hashes match, including the interview, policy, previous snapshots, outputs, and protected Finance and closure code.\n\nStage only these files:\n\nREADME.md\n\nsrc/travel_claim/budget.py\n\nsrc/travel_claim/approvals.py\n\nsrc/travel_claim/integration.py\n\nsrc/travel_claim/offline_replay.py\n\nsrc/travel_claim/ordinary.py\n\nsrc/travel_claim/readiness.py\n\nsrc/travel_claim/snapshots.py\n\ntests/test_budget.py\n\ntests/tes