\nRecommend ONE specific next coding milestone, including its scope, affected files, and tests.\n\nConstraints:\n\nDo not modify any files.\n\nDo not regenerate prior outputs.\n\nDo not stage, commit, or push.\n\nDo not invent missing evidence, approvals, financial decisions, or timestamps.\n\nDo not assume passing tests means full assignment compliance.\n\nReport findings with file paths, line references, and supporting evidence.\n\nFinish with a concise gap table and your recommended Step 182 implementation scope.","type":"input_text"}],"guardian_metadata":{"client_authored":false,"mcp_attribution":{"status":"none"},"retained_source":{"complete":true,"id":{"message_id":"msg_01a13d2b-a688-7ac2-a484-25b11e8403d1","role":"user","turn_id":"01a13d2b-8824-73d0-88b5-8e9d7fe27356"},"revision":"retained_01a13d2b-a688-7ac2-a484-25d4f10745d5"},"user_input_order":213},"id":"msg_01a13d2b-a688-7ac2-a484-25b11e8403d1","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1792027627.057233,"turn_id":"01a13d2b-8824-73d0-88b5-8e9d7fe27356"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"Project D — Step 182: Integrate Policy Evidence and Date-Only Case Clock\n\nCurrent HEAD: d494252163d4082dd9f086c5045496a73d53b237\n\nImplement the Step 182 milestone recommended by the read-only Step 181 audit.\n\nGoal: Make the existing policy-aware workflow reproducible through the CLI using the verified POL-2026.2 browser copy and its calendar-date case clock, without pretending that native Notion retrieval succeeded.\n\nRequirements:\n\nReview the Step 181 audit, current CLI, parsing, offline replay, snapshots, readiness validator, README, and Agent Skill.\n\nAdd explicit CLI support for supplying the verified browser policy as supplemental evidence.\n\nVerify the exact policy bytes and SHA-256:\nf547ee77729be8ad431a5ddf2e2907f94f29ad50092231191abd2f72c04f54d2\n\nPreserve its provenance as a user-provided browser copy. Never label it as a successful native Notion acquisition.\n\nBind policy version POL-2026.2, source references, provenance, case date 2026-11-15, and timezone Europe/Amsterdam into newly generated run evidence.\n\nSupport calendar-date precision without inventing a time of day. Hold decisions where same-day event ordering cannot be established.\n\nPreserve the original five-source acquisition observations and their failure or success statuses.\n\nExtend readiness validation to distinguish native source evidence from supplemental policy evidence and validate both accurately.\n\nUpdate README and the Agent Skill with the exact reproducible invocation.\n\nAdd focused tests covering valid binding, tampering, missing evidence, date-only clocks, uncertain event ordering, provenance, immutable prior runs, and readiness.\n\nConstraints:\n\nDo not change financial closure, cancellation-resolution, approval, or budget business rules in this milestone.\n\nDo not regenerate or overwrite earlier run artifacts.\n\nDo not invent approvals, payments, timestamps, or missing evidence.\n\nDo not stage, commit, or push.\n\nPreserve all 129 protected files.\n\nRun the full test suite and Git diff checks.\n\nReport the changed files, test count, preservation results, remaining blockers, and any failed checks.\n\nStop if a requirement cannot be implemented without inventing evidence or changing protected financial decisions.","type":"input_text"}],"guardian_metadata":{"client_authored":false,"mcp_attribution":{"status":"none"},"retained_source":{"complete":true,"id":{"message_id":"msg_01a13d2f-3cab-7943-8684-487b3739a569","role":"user","turn_id":"01a13d2f-33b9-79d2-86e5-590034036e86"},"revision":"retained_01a13d2f-3cab-7943-8684-489b1504b82f"},"user_input_order":218},"id":"msg_01a13d2f-3cab-7943-8684-487b3739a569","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1792027868.3313313,"turn_id":"01a13d2f-33b9-79d2-86e5-590034036e86"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content"