d run issues in this offline replay are separate from claim repairs. Supplemental browser evidence, when bound above, does not convert native acquisition failures into successes.\\\",\\n        \\\"\\\",\\n    ])\\n    for blocker in parsed.get(\\\"unresolved_issues\\\", []):\\n        lines.append(\\n            f\\\"- `{blocker['record_id']}` ({blocker.get('subject_type')} `{blocker.get('subject_id')}`): \\\"\\n            f\\\"{blocker['reason']} Owner: {blocker['owner']}. Next: {blocker['next_action']} \\\"\\n            f\\\"Evidence needed: {blocker.get('evidence_needed', 'see source issue')}\\\"\\n        )\\n    lines.extend([\\n        \\\"\\\",\\n        \\\"## Outputs\\\",\\n        \\\"\\\",\\n        f\\\"- Current claims: `{output_paths['claims'].name}` (exact required CSV columns).\\\",\\n        f\\\"- Full integration state and source-linked histories: `{output_paths['state'].name}`.\\\",\\n        f\\\"- Repair queue: `{output_paths['queue'].name}` (grouped by owner, item identity retained).\\\",\\n        f\\\"- Owner follow-up drafts: `{output_paths['drafts'].name}` (human review required; not sent).\\\",\\n        \\\"\\\",\\n        \\\"For an authoritative live-source run, perform fresh reads of all five source locations, retain accessible native policy content, and preserve clock evidence at its supplied precision. Supplemental browser evidence does not establish native access. This replay does not modify source content or send requests.\\\",\\n        \\\"\\\",\\n    ])\\n    return \\\"\\\\n\\\".join(lines)\\n\\n\\n-rw-r--r-- 1 maxg maxg  19K Oct 15 09:20 /tmp/project-d-step189-verified-f7ujnbxw/policy-replay/claims.csv\\n-rw-r--r-- 1 maxg maxg 229M Oct 15 09:20 /tmp/project-d-step189-verified-f7ujnbxw/policy-replay/offline-replay-state.json\\n-rw-r--r-- 1 maxg maxg 5.4M Oct 15 09:20 /tmp/project-d-step189-verified-f7ujnbxw/policy-replay/report.md\\n# Project D follow-up drafts — OFFLINE REPLAY\\n\\n**DRAFTS — HUMAN REVIEW REQUIRED — NOT SE